WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.839 --> 00:00:15.640
Soon the first pack of monsters reached the woods.

2
00:00:17.220 --> 00:00:20.101
Up ahead, Ben could see Brunhilda limping.

3
00:00:20.881 --> 00:00:24.902
A minute later she ran off the course, dropping out of the race.

4
00:00:24.922 --> 00:00:27.323
"Hmm," Ben thought.

5
00:00:27.823 --> 00:00:30.364
That seemed suspicious, but what could he do?

6
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:35.524
Besides, Mog had told his team to keep moving, no matter what.

7
00:00:36.485 --> 00:00:39.167
As they entered the woods, Gaby slowed down.

8
00:00:40.088 --> 00:00:42.510
She kept banging her head on the tree branches.

9
00:00:42.530 --> 00:00:47.474
"Ouch!" Then Lon, who'd had a quick start, began to tire.

10
00:00:48.214 --> 00:00:50.316
Zork and Mog quickly passed him.

11
00:00:50.857 --> 00:00:52.358
Ben zoomed through the woods.

12
00:00:52.858 --> 00:00:55.220
He was able to float right through tree branches.

13
00:00:55.881 --> 00:00:59.224
But Cleo's wrapping seemed to get snagged every few feet.

14
00:01:00.008 --> 00:01:02.870
"She's never going to catch up to me," Ben realized.

15
00:01:02.890 --> 00:01:07.072
"Now it's just Zork and Carly against me, Mog, and Deb.

16
00:01:07.672 --> 00:01:09.813
Team Black can totally win this race!"

17
00:01:10.434 --> 00:01:14.956
The two doppelgangers were running right behind Ben, both looking winded.

18
00:01:15.917 --> 00:01:18.978
Abruptly Mog halted, clutching his leg.

19
00:01:18.998 --> 00:01:20.999
"I pulled a muscle.

20
00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:22.660
Catch Zork, Ben!"

21
00:01:23.421 --> 00:01:23.881
"I will!"

22
00:01:24.121 --> 00:01:26.702
Ben shot forward, determined to take the lead.

23
00:01:27.163 --> 00:01:31.173
By now Ben could see the clearing ahead—and the last part of the trail.

24
00:01:31.753 --> 00:01:33.514
He wasn't too far behind Zork.

25
00:01:34.355 --> 00:01:38.417
Once they were out of the woods, he could put on a last burst of speed and make

26
00:01:38.457 --> 00:01:39.758
it to the finish line first.

27
00:01:48.222 --> 00:01:52.805
Ben surged ahead, keeping the focus on his own pace, rather than Zork's.

28
00:01:53.545 --> 00:01:58.348
Near the finish line he could see Brunhilda, her ankle wrapped in bandages.

29
00:01:59.112 --> 00:02:03.673
Miss Bungle was rushing toward her, with Winnie and Serena racing after her.

30
00:02:03.693 --> 00:02:05.114
"Zork, look!"

31
00:02:05.494 --> 00:02:07.054
Ben pointed toward the witches.

32
00:02:07.614 --> 00:02:10.735
When Zork saw Brunhilda, his eyes went wide.

33
00:02:10.755 --> 00:02:14.236
"Ompf!" He tripped over his tail and pitched forward.

34
00:02:14.896 --> 00:02:16.437
Now Ben knew he could do it.

35
00:02:17.397 --> 00:02:20.518
Zooming forward, he sailed across the finish line.

36
00:02:21.958 --> 00:02:26.239
Students began cheering, and the cheerleaders waved their black pom-poms.

37
00:02:26.719 --> 00:02:30.845
"Yes!" Ben cried, collapsing on the ground.

38
00:02:31.386 --> 00:02:33.467
Mr. Gwarg spoke into a megaphone.

39
00:02:33.487 --> 00:02:39.490
"Team Black has won the cross-country event, tying the overall score.

40
00:02:40.110 --> 00:02:46.474
The next monster who crosses the finish line will win the championship for his or her team!"

41
00:02:47.254 --> 00:02:49.576
Ben lifted his head to look toward the woods.

42
00:02:52.317 --> 00:02:52.958
"Oh no!"

43
00:02:53.318 --> 00:02:53.918
he murmured.

44
00:02:54.699 --> 00:02:56.780
Carly was racing toward the finish line.

45
00:02:57.536 --> 00:03:01.397
Fans of Team Orange erupted in loud cheers as she crossed it.

46
00:03:02.898 --> 00:03:05.578
Mr. Freaky's noses wiggled with excitement.

47
00:03:07.399 --> 00:03:10.140
"Team Orange is our new Field Day champion.

48
00:03:10.660 --> 00:03:12.880
But let's cheer for both teams.

49
00:03:13.240 --> 00:03:18.282
Remember our Monster Academy motto—if you had fun, you won!"

50
00:03:19.142 --> 00:03:21.383
Ben sat up, staring at Carly.

51
00:03:22.203 --> 00:03:24.043
Something was wrong, he thought.

52
00:03:24.603 --> 00:03:28.505
Then he realized what it was—Carly wasn't wearing an orange shirt.

53
00:03:28.925 --> 00:03:30.025
Her shirt was black.

54
00:03:30.705 --> 00:03:34.106
Zork zipped over the finish line, followed by another runner.

55
00:03:34.126 --> 00:03:36.087
"That's Carly too!"

56
00:03:36.367 --> 00:03:37.047
Ben cried.

57
00:03:37.907 --> 00:03:41.709
The first Carly flashed a grin at Ben and quickly shifted shapes.

58
00:03:41.729 --> 00:03:43.689
"Deb!" he cried.

59
00:03:43.709 --> 00:03:48.311
"Carly was using kangaroo feet again," Deb explained.

60
00:03:48.331 --> 00:03:51.331
"So I decided to use my abilities too.

61
00:03:51.792 --> 00:03:59.055
I changed my face—" "Because you knew that Brunhilda would be confused and wouldn't risk sabotaging the real

62
00:03:59.115 --> 00:04:00.756
Carly!" "Yep!"

63
00:04:01.196 --> 00:04:01.837
Deb grinned.

64
00:04:01.857 --> 00:04:05.038
"It was worth a try—and it worked great."

65
00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:12.082
With help from Winnie and Serena, Team Black explained everything to the adults.

66
00:04:12.923 --> 00:04:17.846
Miss Bungle was still speaking sternly with Brunhilda, who was sobbing loudly.

67
00:04:21.992 --> 00:04:23.353
"Correction, everyone!"

68
00:04:23.814 --> 00:04:27.236
Mr. Freaky ran to the center of the field, flapping his arms.

69
00:04:27.256 --> 00:04:30.258
"There's been a mistake, but don't worry.

70
00:04:30.798 --> 00:04:32.940
Field Day is completely under control!

71
00:04:37.103 --> 00:04:39.224
Team Black is our winner."

72
00:04:40.085 --> 00:04:44.268
Wild cheers rang out as Team Black did a celebration dance on the field.

73
00:04:46.529 --> 00:04:49.952
When school was over for the day, Ben found Winnie at her locker.

74
00:04:50.832 --> 00:04:51.953
She smiled at him.

75
00:04:51.973 --> 00:04:53.854
"Congratulations again!"

76
00:04:53.874 --> 00:04:56.816
"Thanks." Ben was smiling too.

77
00:04:56.836 --> 00:05:00.379
"It feels pretty great to be a Field Day champion."

78
00:05:00.399 --> 00:05:07.624
"I heard that Brunhilda and Zork are in big trouble," Winnie said.

79
00:05:07.644 --> 00:05:10.406
"They were the only ones on Team Orange who cheated."

80
00:05:10.426 --> 00:05:15.849
"It's a good thing that you and Serena noticed something weird was going on," Ben said.

81
00:05:15.869 --> 00:05:17.791
"Speaking of weird."

82
00:05:18.391 --> 00:05:19.332
Winnie looked down.

83
00:05:19.984 --> 00:05:21.846
"Sorry that I've been acting strange.

84
00:05:22.306 --> 00:05:24.588
My cousin causes so much commotion.

85
00:05:25.069 --> 00:05:28.131
It's not easy being around such a beautiful witch."

86
00:05:28.151 --> 00:05:29.713
"Yes, it is!"

87
00:05:29.973 --> 00:05:30.874
Ben blurted out.

88
00:05:31.675 --> 00:05:33.176
Winnie looked up with a smile.

89
00:05:33.656 --> 00:05:36.619
But before she could reply, Mog came rushing up.

90
00:05:36.639 --> 00:05:42.624
"Guys! We need to say thank you to Serena for helping Team Black win Field Day.

91
00:05:43.085 --> 00:05:44.006
She's right over there."

92
00:05:44.946 --> 00:05:46.348
Ben looked down the hallway.

93
00:05:47.240 --> 00:05:52.662
As usual, Serena was surrounded by lots of monsters, all trying desperately to impress her.

94
00:05:52.682 --> 00:05:56.464
"I doubt we'll be able to get her attention right now, Mog."

95
00:05:57.564 --> 00:06:00.566
"We're the new Field Day champions," Mog said.

96
00:06:00.586 --> 00:06:04.407
"So everybody should be paying attention to us, not her!"

97
00:06:06.768 --> 00:06:10.030
Ben laughed, and to his delight, so did Winnie.

98
00:06:10.050 --> 00:06:13.911
"Come on," she said.

99
00:06:13.931 --> 00:06:15.572
"Let's go talk to her."
